    "created_at": "2026-07-16T13:28:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-16T13:28:54Z",
    "body": "Totally agree that `removeUnsafe()` being incomplete for `setHTMLUnsafe()` can be a bit of a footgun. Maybe that's worth at least documenting or pointing out otherwise such that people aren't bit by this too hard.\n\nBut as a better solution, I agree it would be good  to have a more specific attribute-value API to ensure we can fit all use cases.",
