    "created_at": "2026-09-03T08:48:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-03T08:48:40Z",
    "body": "We discussed this in the WHATNOT meeting. We agree we want a boolean, named `javascriptURLs`.\n* introduce the option for the config dictionary\n* default to false (e.g., not allowing them)\n* add a method for the Sanitizer object to modify the value\n* the steps for `removeUnsafe()` need to switch the bool such that they are not allowed in a safe configuration.\n\n\nNext step: @noamr  will come up with a pull request",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
